# Lab UPS — same APC Smart-UPS 1500, during a mains outage: on battery for five
# minutes, battery low (upsBatteryStatus 3), 6 minutes left, 24 % charge, input
# voltage/frequency at zero, one active alarm (upsAlarmOnBattery).
# Same address as `ups`: switch the device's community from `ups` to
# `ups-onbattery` to replay the outage, and back to recover.
